    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προευ-πορέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>provide in advance,</i> prob. (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεμπορίζω</span>) in <i><span class="en">
